#: aboutwidget.cpp:45 main.cpp:105
msgid "KDE Control Center"
msgstr "Cinte di contrôle di KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:47
msgid "Configure your desktop environment."
msgstr "Apontyîz li scribanne da vosse."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:49
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Control Center\", a central place to configure your "
"desktop environment. Select an item from the index on the left to load a "
"configuration module."
msgstr ""
"Wilicome å \"Cinte di contrôle di KDE\", ene plaece å cinte po-z apontyî "
"vosse evironmint d' sicribanne. Tchoezixhoz on cayet di l' indecse a hintche "
"po tcherdjî on module d' apontiaedje."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:55 main.cpp:109
msgid "KDE Info Center"
msgstr "Cinte d' informåcion di KDE"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:57
msgid "Get system and desktop environment information"
msgstr "Aveur des informåcions sol sistinme et l' evironmint d' sicribanne"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Welcome to the \"KDE Info Center\", a central place to find information "
"about your computer system."
msgstr ""
"Wilicome å \"Cinte d' informåcion di KDE\", ene plaece å cinte po trover les "
"informåcions sol sistinme di vosse copiutrece."

#: aboutwidget.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Click on the \"Help\" tab on the left to view help for the active control "
"module. Use the \"Search\" tab if you are unsure where to look for a "
"particular configuration option."
msgstr ""

#: aboutwidget.cpp:69
msgid "KDE version:"
msgstr "Modêye di KDE:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:70
msgid "User:"
msgstr "Uzeu:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:71
msgid "Hostname:"
msgstr "No d' lodjeu:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:72
msgid "System:"
msgstr "Sistinme:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:73
msgid "Release:"
msgstr "Modêye:"

#: aboutwidget.cpp:74
msgid "Machine:"
msgstr "Éndjole:"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:143
msgid "<big><b>Loading...</b></big>"
msgstr "<big><b>Dji tchedje ...</b></big>"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:210 toplevel.cpp:356
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before running the new module or discard "
"the changes?"
msgstr ""
"I gn a des candjmints nén schapés dins l' module en alaedje.\n"
"Voloz vs mete en ouve les candjmints divant d' enonder l' novea module ou "
"disfacer les candjmints?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:213 toplevel.cpp:359
msgid ""
"There are unsaved changes in the active module.\n"
"Do you want to apply the changes before exiting the Control Center or "
"discard the changes?"
msgstr ""
"I gn a des candjmints nén schapés dins l' module en alaedje.\n"
"Voloz vs mete en ouve les candjmints divant d' cwiter l' Cinte di contrôle "
"ou disfacer les candjmints?"

#: dockcontainer.cpp:216 toplevel.cpp:362
msgid "Unsaved Changes"
msgstr "Candjmints nén schapés"

#: helpwidget.cpp:64
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"<p>Use the \"Whats This\" (Shift+F1) to get help on specific options.</"
"p><p>To read the full manual click <a href=\"%1\">here</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""

